itment (3)'s publisher prefix risk is unchanged in the newer note version, so this Work Item is explicitly not flagged for review.\"\n159:       }\n160:     ],\n161:     \"sourceUpdatesDeferred\": [\n162:       {\n163:         \"sourceRecord\": \"CSR-MANUAL-MEETING-001\",\n164:         \"deferredUpdate\": \"Applying the observed drift evidence (com_source_version_ref manual-note-version:2026-07-13:v2, com_content_hash, com_observed_modified_at) to the live record is a receipt-backed mutation gated to Epic 2 Story 2.3; no live tenant write was performed in this slice.\"\n165:       },\n166:       {\n167:         \"sourceRecord\": \"CSR-OUTLOOK-THREAD-MOCK-001\",\n168:         \"deferredUpdate\": \"com_extraction_status may become superseded only through a receipt-backed mutation once Epic 2 Story 2.3 receipt semantics exist; the prior record and the rationale it produced stay unchanged and no live tenant write was performed in this slice.\"\n169:       }\n170:     ],\n171:     \"workItemStateChangesDeferred\": [\n172:       {\n173:         \"workItem\": \"CWI-LOCAL-MEETING-ACTION-001\",\n174:         \"deferredUpdate\": \"Any com_state_group move driven by this drift (for example proposed to in_review) requires a new receipt-backed mutation gated to Epic 2 Story 2.3; this slice records the review flag only and performs no state change.\"\n175:       }\n176:     ]\n177:   },\n178:   \"acceptanceMapping\": [\n179:     {\n180:       \"acceptanceCriterion\": 1,\n181:       \"localEvidence\": [\n182:         \"driftRun.driftEvents for CSR-MANUAL-MEETING-001 with new com_source_version_ref, com_content_hash, and com_observed_modified_at later than capture, plus a prior-evidence block stating no prior version ref was recorded\",\n183:         \"driftRun.receipts CR-LOCAL-DRIFT-001 (verb source_drifted) bound to the drifted source by a drift_evidence receiptSourceLinks entry\",\n184:         \"driftRun.supersessions embeds CSR-OUTLOOK-THREAD-MOCK-002 superseding CSR-OUTLOOK-THREAD-MOCK-001 via com_parent_ref with receipt CR-LOCAL-SUPERSEDE-001 (before held, after superseded)\",\n185:         \"guards.priorRationaleAndReceiptsUnchanged=true; the superseded extraction status appears only inside sourceUpdatesDeferred and no 1.1-1.4 artifact is modified\"\n186:       ],\n187:       \"tenantEvidenceRequired\": \"Live drift detection plus applying com_source_version_ref or the superseded extraction status to tenant records are receipt-gated to Epic 2 Story 2.3 and remain VERIFY IN TENANT; this slice is local contract evidence only.\"\n188:     },\n189:     {\n190:       \"acceptanceCriterion\": 2,\n191:       \"localEvidence\": [\n192:         \"driftRun.workItemsFlaggedForReview names only CWI-LOCAL-MEETING-ACTION-001 with a drift-specific reason and flag mechanism\",\n193:         \"driftRun.workItemsUnaffected explicitly clears CWI-LOCAL-DECISION-002 and CWI-LOCAL-RISK-001, the other two Story 1.4 items from the drifted source\",\n194:         \"stateGroupChangedInThisSlice=false and workItemStateChangesDeferred require a new Receipt for any resulting state change\",\n195:         \"guards.noWorkItemStateChangeInThisSlice=true\"\n196:       ],\n197:       \"tenantEvidenceRequired\": \"Surfacing the review flag in the live Council Queue and any receipt-backed com_state_group change remain gated to Epic 2 Story 2.3; no tenant Work Item was modified for this slice.\"\n198:     }\n199:   ]\n200: }\n\n(End of file - total 200 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"{\n  \"artifactVersion\": \"2026-07-13\",\n  \"storyKey\": \"1-5-handle-source-drift-and-supersession\",\n  \"status\": \"local-contract-not-tenant-verified\",\n  \"purpose\": \"Prove source drift and supersession handling locally: a drifted Work-Item-producing source gains new source version evidence plus a source_drifted drift receipt and flags only the affected Work Item for review, while a rationale-producing held source is superseded by a new Source Record via com_parent_ref