tem state columns to change.\",\n          \"exampleExistingRows\": [\n            \"CSR-MANUAL-MEETING-001\",\n            \"CR-LOCAL-DRIFT-001\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"storyKey\": \"2-1-maintain-the-work-item-execution-shell\",\n          \"epic\": 2,\n          \"tables\": [\n            \"com_councilworkitem\",\n            \"com_councilreceipt\"\n          ],\n          \"columnsByTable\": {\n            \"com_councilworkitem\": [\n              \"com_council_work_item_id\",\n              \"com_state_group\",\n              \"com_owner_candidate\",\n              \"com_approved_owner\",\n              \"com_urgency\",\n              \"com_recommended_next_action\",\n              \"com_created_receipt\"\n            ],\n            \"com_councilreceipt\": [\n              \"com_receipt_id\",\n              \"com_work_item\",\n              \"com_verb\",\n              \"com_occurred_at\",\n              \"com_idempotency_key\",\n              \"com_append_only_locked\"\n            ]\n          },\n          \"relationships\": [\n            \"com_councilworkitem.com_created_receipt -> com_councilreceipt\"\n          ],\n          \"views\": [\n            \"Needs Human Approval\"\n          ],\n          \"writeScopeNote\": \"Story 2.1 needs the Work Item execution shell columns and the proposed-verb receipt chain; it must not force approval-scope columns to mutate.\",\n          \"exampleExistingRows\": [\n            \"CWI-LOCAL-SHELL-DECISION-001\",\n            \"CR-LOCAL-SHELL-CREATE-001\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"storyKey\": \"2-3-apply-receipt-backed-queue-state-changes\",\n          \"epic\": 2,\n          \"tables\": [\n            \"com_councilworkitem\",\n            \"com_councilreceipt\",\n            \"com_councilreceiptsource\"\n          ],\n          \"columnsByTable\": {\n            \"com_councilworkitem\": [\n              \"com_council_work_item_id\",\n              \"com_state_group\"\n            ],\n            \"com_councilreceipt\": [\n              \"com_receipt_id\",\n              \"com_work_item\",\n              \"com_verb\",\n              \"com_before_state\",\n              \"com_after_state\",\n              \"com_idempotency_key\",\n              \"com_result\",\n              \"com_append_only_locked\"\n            ],\n            \"com_councilreceiptsource\": [\n              \"com_receipt\",\n              \"com_source_record\",\n              \"com_evidence_role\"\n            ]\n          },\n          \"relationships\": [\n            \"com_councilreceipt.com_work_item -> com_councilworkitem\"\n          ],\n          \"views\": [\n            \"In Review\",\n            \"Completed Recently\",\n            \"Failed Needs Review\"\n          ],\n          \"writeScopeNote\": \"Story 2.3 is the canonical receipt-backed mutation story; every live Dataverse mutation from earlier slices is gated to this story. It needs only the state-change columns and the receipt verbs it exercises.\",\n          \"exampleExistingRows\": [\n            \"CWI-LOCAL-QUEUE-HAPPY-001\",\n            \"CR-LOCAL-STATE-HAPPY-PROPOSED-001\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"storyKey\": \"3-1-create-a-minion-brief-snapshot\",\n          \"epic\": 3,\n          \"tables\": [\n            \"com_councilbrief\"\n          ],\n          \"columnsByTable\": {\n            \"com_councilbrief\": [\n              \"com_name\",\n              \"com_council_brief_id\",\n              \"com_brief_date\",\n              \"com_priority_summary\",\n              \"com_decisions_needed\",\n              \"com_delegations_ready\",\n              \"com_risks_if_ignored\",\n              \"com_blockers\",\n              \"com_recent_receipts\",\n              \"com_memory_candidates\"\n            ]\n          },\n          \"relationships\": [],\n          \"views\": [],\n          \"writeScopeNote\": \"Story 3.1 needs only the Brief table; it must not force Memory or Instruction tables to exist.\",\n          \"exampleExistingRows\": []\n        },\n        {\n          \"storyKey\": \"4-1-create-lightweight-meaning-graph-records\",\n          \"epic\": 4,\n          \"tables\": [\n            \"com_councilgraphentity\",\n            \"com_councilgraphedge\"\n          ],\n          \"columnsByTable\": {\n            \"com_councilgraphentity\": [\n              \"com_name\",\n              \"com_council_graph_entity_id\",\n              \"com_entity_type\",\n              \"com_external_binding_ref\",\n              \"com_semantic_contract_version\",\n              \"com_status\"\n            ],\n            \"com_councilgraphedge\": [\n              \"com_name\",\n              \"com_edge_type\",\n              \"com_from_entity\",\n              \"com_to_entity\",\n              \"com_from_work_item\",\n              \"com_source_record\",\n              \"com_receipt\"\n            ]\n          },\n          \"relationships\": [\n            \"com_councilgraphedge.com_from_entity -> com_councilgraphentity\",\n            \"com_councilgraphedge.com_to_entity -> com_councilgraphentity\"\n          ],\n          \"views\": [],\n          \"writeScopeNote\": \"Story 4.1 needs only Graph Entity and Graph Edge tables; it must not force Memory or Instruction tables to exist.\",\n          \"exampleExistingRows\": []\n        },\n        {\n          \"storyKey\": \"4-4-promote-approved-instructions-with-receipts\",\n          \"epic\": 4,\n          \"tables\": [\n            \"com_councilmemorycandidate\",\n            \"com_councilapprovedinstruction\",\n            \"com_councilreceipt\"\n          ],\n          \"columnsByTable\": {\n            \"com_councilmemorycandidate\": [\n              \"com_council_memory_candidate_id\",\n              \"com_review_state\",\n              \"com_review_receipt\"\n            ],\n            \"com_councilapprovedinstruction\": [\n              \"com_council_approved_instruction_id\",\n              \"com_instruction_text\",\n              \"com_scope\",\n              \"com_approval_receipt\",\n              \"com_status\",\n              \"com_effective_from\",\n              \"com_superseded_by\"\n            ],\n            \"com_councilreceipt\": [\n              \"com_receipt_id\",\n              \"com_verb\",\n              \"com_result\",\n              \"com_append_only_locked\"\n            ]\n          },\n          \"relationships\": [\n            \"com_councilapprovedinstruction.com_approval_receipt -> com_councilreceipt\",\n            \"com_councilapprovedinstruction.com_source_memory_candidate -> com_councilmemorycandidate\"\n          ],\n          \"views\": [\n            \"Memory Receipts\"\n          ],\n          \"writeScopeNote\": \"Story 4.4 needs Memory Candidate, Approved Instruction, and Receipt tables with the memory_promoted verb; it must not force Skill or Minion tables to exist.\",\n          \"exampleExistingRows\": [\n            \"CR-LOCAL-MEMORY-001\"\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"rollbackAuditBoundaries\": [\n      {\n        \"plannedWriteScope\": \"Epic 2 Story 2.3 apply-receipt-backed-queue-state-changes\",\n        \"storyKey\": \"2-3-apply-receipt-backed-queue-state-changes\",\n        \"writeScopeKey\": \"state-change-mutation\",\n        \"rollbackBoundary\": \"Roll back to the last append-only receipt boundary: every com_councilreceipt row is append-only (com_append_only_locked=true), so a failed state-change apply is rolled back by appending a corrective receipt rather than editing or deleting prior rows; the affected com_councilworkitem.com_state_group is restored to the before-state recorded on the failed receipt.\",\n        \"auditBoundary\": \"Every state-change write emits a manifest-verb com_councilreceipt with com_before_state, com_after_state, com_idempotency_key, and com_evidence_refs; the receipt is the audit row. No state change is auditably complete without a backing receipt.\",\n        \"receiptGate\": \"Live com_councilworkitem.com_state_group mutation is receipt-gated to Epic 2 Story 2.3; no live mutation is performed in this slice.\",\n        \"exampleExistingRows\": [\n          \"CWI-LOCAL-QUEUE-HAPPY-001\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"plannedWriteScope\": \"Epic 1 Story 1.5 handle-source-drift-and-supersession live apply\",\n        \"storyKey\": \"1-5-handle-source-drift-and-supersession\",\n        \"writeScopeKey\": \"source-drift-supersession\",\n        \"rollbackBoundary\": \"Roll back to the prior source version: a supersession is reversed by capturing a new superseding record that points com_parent_ref back at the pre-supersession record, never by editing the superseded record or its prior rationale; the superseded record and its receipts stay byte-identical.\",\n        \"auditBoundary\": \"Every drift/supersession write emits a source_drifted com_councilreceipt bound to its source evidence by a com_councilreceiptsource row with com_evidence_role=drift_evidence; the drift receipt is the audit row for the version transition.\",\n        \"receiptGate\": \"Live com_councilsourcerecord version/supersession mutation is receipt-gated to Epic 2 Story 2.3; no live mutation is performed in this slice.\",\n        \"exampleExistingRows\": [\n          \"CSR-OUTLOOK-THREAD-MOCK-001\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"plannedWriteScope\": \"Dataverse MVP schema apply (dataverse-apply-mvp-schema.ps1 with -ExecuteWrites)\",\n        \"storyKey\": \"5-5-validate-dataverse-mvp-operational-store-readiness\",\n        \"writeScopeKey\": \"schema-apply\",\n        \"rollbackBoundary\": \"Roll back the schema apply by deleting the CouncilOfMinionsMVP unmanaged solution in the sandbox environment; unmanaged solution deletion removes the Council tables/choices it introduced. The committed dataverse-mvp-schema-manifest.json is the re-apply source of truth, and the tenant decision packet records Doug's approval before any such apply runs.\",\n        \"auditBoundary\": \"The schema apply is gated behind a Doug-approved read-only preflight that proves target.environmentId and target.organizationId match `pac env who`; the preflight evidence and the tenant decision packet are the audit trail for the write authorization. The apply script's DRY RUN ONLY marker is the no-write boundary until approval.\",\n        \"receiptGate\": \"The schema apply itself is not a Council receipt event; it is a platform provisioning step approved through the tenant decision packet. It must stay in DRY RUN ONLY mode (writeScriptsDisabled=true) until Doug approves dataverseSandboxWrites and publisherPrefix.\",\n        \"exampleExistingRows\": []\n      }\n    ],\n    \"referencedIds\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"CSR-MANUAL-SUMMARY-001\",\n        \"idType\": \"CSR\",\n        \"sourceSlice\": \"manual-source-record-slice.json\",\n        \"referenceRole\": \"example-existing-source-row-in-scope-of-story-1.1-and-2.3-writes\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"CSR-MANUAL-MEETING-001\",\n        \"idType\": \"CSR\",\n        \"sourceSlice\": \"zero-multi-item-extraction-slice.json\",\n        \"referenceRole\": \"example-existing-source-row-in-scope-of-story-1.5-drift-writes\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"CSR-OUTLOOK-THREAD-MOCK-001\",\n        \"idType\": \"CSR\",\n        \"sourceSlice\": \"outlook-source-reference-slice.json\",\n        \"referenceRole\": \"example-superseded-source-row-in-rollback-boundary-for-story-1.5\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"CWI-LOCAL-DECISION-001\",\n        \"idType\": \"CWI\",\n        \"sourceSlice\": \"proposed-work-item-extraction-slice.json\",\n        \"referenceRole\": \"example-existing-work-item-row-in-scope-of-story-1.3-writes\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"CWI-LOCAL-SHELL-DECISION-001\",\n        \"idType\": \"CWI\",\n        \"sourceSlice\": \"work-item-execution-shell-slice.json\",\n        \"referenceRole\": \"example-existing-work-item-row-in-scope-of-story-2.1-writes\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"CWI-LOCAL-QUEUE-HAPPY-001\",\n        \"idType\": \"CWI\",\n        \"sourceSlice\": \"receipt-backed-state-changes-slice.json\",\n        \"referenceRole\": \"example-existing-work-item-row-in-rollback-boundary-for-story-2.3\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"CR-LOCAL-APPROVAL-PROPOSED-001\",\n        \"idType\": \"CR\",\n        \"sourceSlice\": \"approval-boundaries-slice.json\",\n        \"referenceRole\": \"example-existing-receipt-row-in-scope-of-story-1.3-writes\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"CR-LOCAL-DRIFT-001\",\n        \"idType\": \"CR\",\n        \"sourceSlice\": \"source-drift-supersession-slice.json\",\n        \"referenceRole\": \"example-existing-receipt-row-in-audit-boundary-for-story-1.5\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"CR-LOCAL-SHELL-CREATE-001\",\n        \"idType\": \"CR\",\n        \"sourceSlice\": \"work-item-execution-shell-slice.json\",\n        \"referenceRole\": \"example-existing-receipt-row-in-scope-of-story-2.1-writes\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"CR-LOCAL-STATE-HAPPY-PROPOSED-001\",\n        \"idType\": \"CR\",\n        \"sourceSlice\": \"receipt-backed-state-changes-slice.json\",\n        \"referenceRole\": \"example-existing-receipt-row-in-rollback-boundary-for-story-2.3\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"CR-LOCAL-MEMORY-001\",\n        \"idType\": \"CR\",\n        \"sourceSlice\": \"memory-candidates-slice.json\",\n        \"referenceRole\": \"example-existing-receipt-row-in-scope-of-story-4.4-writes\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"writesDeferred\": [\n      {\n        \"deferredWrite\": \"Live `pac auth who`, `pac env who`, and `pac env list-settings` preflight execution\",\n        \"receiptGate\": \"Deferred to a Doug-approved read-only preflight under the Epic 5 tenant-readiness gate; no live pac call is performed in this slice.\",\n        \"evidenceState\": \"deferred-to-tenant\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"