ytics) stay DEFERRED until the MVP contracts stabilize, and that graph/ontology expansion never owns workflow state. Three Phase-2 projection plans are catalogued with their triggering stability criteria, each marked phase:2, deferredUntil:'mvp-contracts-stable', and ownsWorkflowState:false. A premature-activation attempt yields a policy-denial receipt and the projection remains deferred. The 4-5 semantic-contract projection slice is cross-referenced (planes are projections only) — referenced, not duplicated. Local contract evidence only; every would-be live plane write appears as a deferred entry naming its receipt gate.\",\n  \"guards\": {\n    \"noTenantWrites\": true,\n    \"noOutboundAction\": true,\n    \"noApprovalExecution\": true,\n    \"requiresExplicitHumanApprovalForExecution\": true,\n    \"receiptsAreLocalContractEvidenceOnly\": true,\n    \"phase2ProjectionsDeferredUntilMvpContractsStable\": true,\n    \"projectionsNeverOwnWorkflowState\": true,\n    \"prematureActivationPolicyDenied\": true,\n    \"planesAreProjectionsOnly\": true,\n    \"noCanonicalAuthoringInPlanes\": true,\n    \"semanticContractProjectionCrossReferencedNotDuplicated\": true,\n    \"noPhase2PlaneWriteInThisSlice\": true\n  },\n  \"phase2ProjectionRun\": {","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/home/doug/.ringer/work/bmad-hybrid/5-6-manage-phase-2-knowledge-and-analytics-projections/_bmad-output/implementation-artifacts/phase2-projections-slice.json","text":"{\n  \"artifactVersion\": \"2026-07-13\",\n  \"storyKey\": \"5-6-manage-phase-2-knowledge-and-analytics-projections\",\n  \"status\": \"local-contract-not-tenant-verified\",\n  \"purpose\": \"Prove that Phase-2 knowledge and analytics projections (Fabric knowledge, Copilot Studio surface, analytics) stay DEFERRED until the MVP contracts stabilize, and that graph/ontology expansion never owns workflow state. Three Phase-2 projection plans are catalogued with their triggering stability criteria, each marked phase:2, deferredUntil:'mvp-contracts-stable', and ownsWorkflowState:false. A premature-activation attempt yields a policy-denial receipt and the projection remains deferred. The 4-5 semantic-contract projection slice is cross-referenced (planes are projections only) — referenced, not duplicated. Local contract evidence only; every would-be live plane write appears as a deferred entry naming its receipt gate.\",\n  \"guards\": {\n    \"noTenantWrites\": true,\n    \"noOutboundAction\": true,\n    \"noApprovalExecution\": true,\n    \"requiresExplicitHumanApprovalForExecution\": true,\n    \"receiptsAreLocalContractEvidenceOnly\": true,\n    \"phase2ProjectionsDeferredUntilMvpContractsStable\": true,\n    \"projectionsNeverOwnWorkflowState\": true,\n    \"prematureActivationPolicyDenied\": true,\n    \"planesAreProjectionsOnly\": true,\n    \"noCanonicalAuthoringInPlanes\": true,\n    \"semanticContractProjectionCrossReferencedNotDuplicated\": true,\n    \"noPhase2PlaneWriteInThisSlice\": true\n  },\n  \"phase2ProjectionRun\": {\n    \"runId\": \"PHASE2PROJ-LOCAL-2026-07-13-001\",\n    \"actorType\": \"system\",\n    \"actorId\": \"local-bmad-validator\",\n    \"authorityBasis\": \"local non-tenant Story 5.6 contract validation\",\n    \"semanticContractVersion\": \"2026-07-07\",\n    \"canonicalSource\": \"council-semantic-contract\",\n    \"deferredUntil\": \"mvp-contracts-stable\",\n    \"inputVocabularyFrom\": [\n      \"dataverse-mvp-schema-manifest.json\",\n      \"semantic-contract-projection-slice.json\"\n    ],\n    \"decisionPolicy\": {\n      \"phase2ProjectionsDeferredUntilMvpContractsStable\": true,\n      \"projectionPlansNeverOwnWorkflowState\": true,\n      \"prematureActivationYieldsPolicyDenial\": true,\n      \"stabilityCriteriaMustBeNamedPerPlan\": true,\n      \"planesAreProjectionsOnly\": true,\n      \"semanticContractProjectionSliceReferencedNotDuplicated\": true,\n      \"livePhase2PlaneWritesReceiptGated\": true\n    },\n    \"projectionPlans\": [\n      {\n        \"planId\": \"PHASE2-PLAN-LOCAL-001\",\n        \"planName\": \"Fabric knowledge projection (Phase 2)\",\n        \"phase\": 2,\n        \"targetSurface\": \"fabric-iq-ontology\",\n        \"deferredUntil\": \"mvp-contracts-stable\",\n        \"triggeringStabilityCriteria\": [\n          \"Epic 2 receipt-backed Work Item state changes (Story 2.3) are tenant-verified and stable\",\n          \"Epic 4 Council Semantic Contract vocabulary (com_graphedgetype / com_graphentitytype) is tenant-verified and frozen for re-projection\",\n          \"Story 4.5 semantic-contract projection slice projectionManifest has been tenant-verified against the live Dataverse semantic model and Fabric IQ ontology without unresolved drift\"\n        ],\n        \"ownsWorkflowState\": false,\n        \"planRationale\": \"Fabric IQ ontology becomes a projection surface for Council knowledge once the MVP contracts that define Work Item state, source-record capture, and semantic-contract vocabulary are stable. Until then this plan stays deferred; ontology expansion may only propose terms back to the Council Semantic Contract and never owns workflow state.\",\n        \"referencedSemanticContractProjectionSlice\": \"semantic-contract-projection-slice.json\",\n        \"referencedProjectionIds\": [\n          \"PROJ-LOCAL-SCP-003\",\n          \"PROJ-LOCAL-SCP-004\",\n          \"PROJ-LOCAL-SCP-005\"\n        ],\n        \"plannedProjectionSurface\": \"Fabric IQ ontology entities/edges projected from council-semantic-contract; no Work Item execution authority\",\n        \"liveWriteDeferredTo\": \"receipt-gated post mvp-contracts-stable; no tenant write in this slice\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"planId\": \"PHASE2-PLAN-LOCAL-002\",\n        \"planName\": \"Copilot Studio surface projection (Phase 2)\",\n        \"phase\": 2,\n        \"targetSurface\": \"copilot-studio-surface\",\n        \"deferredUntil\": \"mvp-contracts-stable\",\n        \"triggeringStabilityCriteria\": [\n          \"Epic 2 approval boundaries (Story 2.2) are tenant-verified so Copilot surface actions never bypass human approval\",\n          \"Epic 3 handoff/reply drafts (Story 3.3) are tenant-verified for the outbound-action contract the Copilot surface would invoke\",\n          \"Story 4.4 approved-instruction receipts are tenant-verified so the Copilot surface only acts on receipt-backed approved instructions\"\n        ],\n        \"ownsWorkflowState\": false,\n        \"planRationale\": \"A Copilot Studio surface becomes the conversational projection of Council Work Items only once the approval-boundary, handoff, and approved-instruction MVP contracts are stable. The surface projects Council state read-only and routes any action through the receipt-gated MVP contracts; it never owns workflow state and never writes directly to Dataverse.\",\n        \"referencedSemanticContractProjectionSlice\": \"semantic-contract-projection-slice.json\",\n        \"referencedProjectionIds\": [\n          \"PROJ-LOCAL-SCP-001\",\n          \"PROJ-LOCAL-SCP-002\",\n          \"PROJ-LOCAL-SCP-006\"\n        ],\n        \"plannedProjectionSurface\": \"Copilot Studio topic/action projecting Council Work Items and Receipts read-only; outbound actions route through Epic 2/3 receipt gates\",\n        \"liveWriteDeferredTo\": \"receipt-gated post mvp-contracts-stable; no tenant write in this slice\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"planId\": \"PHASE2-PLAN-LOCAL-003\",\n        \"planName\": \"Analytics projection (Phase 2)\",\n        \"phase\": 2,\n        \"targetSurface\": \"analytics-warehouse\",\n        \"deferredUntil\": \"mvp-contracts-stable\",\n        \"triggeringStabilityCriteria\": [\n          \"Epic 2 idempotent-mutation receipts (Story 2.4) are tenant-verified so analytics can replay receipt-backed state deterministically\",\n          \"Epic 1 source-record and Work Item schemas (Stories 1.1-1.5) are tenant-verified and frozen for analytics modeling\",\n   