m_council_capability\": \"memory-and-graph-grounding\",\n            \"com_microsoft_candidate\": \"Work IQ\",\n            \"com_official_source_date_checked\": \"2026-07-07\",\n            \"com_tenant_gate\": \"Work IQ is not provisioned in the sdhdev tenant as of 2026-07-07; onboarding requires a tenant admin to enable the Work IQ service plan and confirm data residency. Pending tenant verification.\",\n            \"com_permission_dlp_impact\": \"Work IQ would index source-derived content; under the link_only/hash_only source-body policy the tenant DLP classification for Council sources must be confirmed before Work IQ indexing is allowed. Not yet tenant-verified.\",\n            \"com_licensing_cost_gate\": \"Work IQ licensing SKU and per-user licensing cost are not confirmed for this tenant; assumed to require a premium SK series. Pending tenant verification.\",\n            \"com_lifecycle_alm_path\": \"Work IQ artifacts do not have a confirmed Dataverse-solution-aware ALM path aligned with the CouncilOfMinionsMVP solution; ALM story is assumed unverified.\",\n            \"com_contract_gaps\": \"Gap: Work IQ has no documented append-only receipt ledger projection with idempotency-key alternate key and before/after state lineage matching the com_councilreceipt contract; it is not solution-aware in the CouncilOfMinionsMVP solution today.\",\n            \"com_decision\": \"defer\",\n            \"com_review_reference\": \"Defer until Work IQ is provisioned in the tenant and its receipt-ledger alignment is tested; revisit after Epic 2 receipt semantics land.\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"rowId\": \"PE-LOCAL-EVAL-001-ROW-02\",\n            \"com_name\": \"Platform evaluation - memory/graph grounding - Dataverse intelligence/MCP\",\n            \"com_council_capability\": \"memory-and-graph-grounding\",\n            \"com_microsoft_candidate\": \"Dataverse intelligence/MCP\",\n            \"com_official_source_date_checked\": \"2026-07-07\",\n     