backed mutation gated to approval receipt CR-LOCAL-SKILL-APPROVE-001 and to Epic 2; no live tenant write was performed in this slice.\"\n314:       },\n315:       {\n316:         \"skill\": \"CSK-LOCAL-FABRIC-PUBLISHER-001\",\n317:         \"gateReceipt\": \"CR-LOCAL-SKILL-DENY-001\",\n318:         \"deferredUpdate\": \"The denied expansion is recorded for future review only; the live skill row stays candidate/manual_only with empty authority. Any re-scoped proposal requires a NEW approval receipt; no live tenant write was performed in this slice.\"\n319:       }\n320:     ]\n321:   },\n322:   \"acceptanceMapping\": [\n323:     {\n324:       \"acceptanceCriterion\": 1,\n325:       \"localEvidence\": [\n326:         \"expansionRun.skills CSK-LOCAL-MEETING-DIGEST-001 with skillRecord candidate/manual_only and proposedExpansion beforeAuthoritySet (manual_only, empty scopes) and proposedAfterAuthoritySet (ask_before_use, dataScopes outlook.calendar.read + dataverse.com_councilworkitem.read, tools email.send, externalActions send_email_on_behalf) plus declaredDelta naming exactly the added scopes/tools/actions and the authority class change\",\n327:         \"expansionRun.receipts CR-LOCAL-SKILL-APPROVE-001 (verb approved, actor_type human, actor_id Doug, com_authority_basis, com_decision_rationale, com_evidence_refs CSK-LOCAL-MEETING-DIGEST-001; CSR-MANUAL-MEETING-001, result accepted) carries beforeAuthoritySet and afterAuthoritySet matching the proposedExpansion before/after authority sets\",\n328:         \"expansionRun.skills CSK-LOCAL-MEETING-DIGEST-001 activation.gateReceipt=CR-LOCAL-SKILL-APPROVE-001 (a real slice receipt with verb approved/result accepted), activation.effectiveAt 2026-07-14T10:30:00-04:00 is on or after the approval receipt com_occurred_at 2026-07-14T10:15:00-04:00 (temporal + receipt-chain, not a self-asserted flag), and activation.activatedAuthoritySet equals proposedAfterAuthoritySet\",\n329:         \"guards.authorityExpansionRequiresExplicitApprovalReceipt=true and guards.activationStrictlyFollowsApprovalReceipt=true\"\n330:       ],\n331:       \"tenantEvidenceRequired\": \"Writing the live Skill row, applying the approved authority set, and recording the approval receipt to tenant Dataverse tables are receipt-gated to Epic 2; this slice is local contract evidence only.\"\n332:     },\n333:     {\n334:       \"acceptanceCriterion\": 2,\n335:       \"localEvidence\": [\n336:         \"expansionRun.skills CSK-LOCAL-FABRIC-PUBLISHER-001 with decision=denied, skillRecord com_status candidate (non-active) and com_authority_class manual_only, and denial.effectiveAuthoritySet equal to proposedExpansion.beforeAuthoritySet (manual_only, empty scopes) proving the skill is constrained to its before authority and not activated\",\n337:         \"expansionRun.receipts CR-LOCAL-SKILL-DENY-001 (verb policy_denied, result rejected, com_failure_code skill_authority_expansion_denied declared in failureCodeVocabulary, policy_flags carrying policy_denied + human_approval_required + write_scope_not_auto_approved + external_action_requires_human_approval + approved_automatic_not_granted_without_prior_use_history) and denial.denialRationale non-empty so the rationale is visible for future review\",\n338:         \"expansionRun.skills CSK-LOCAL-FABRIC-PUBLISHER-001 has no activation block (denied expansions do not activate) and skillUpdatesDeferred records that the live skill row stays candidate/manual_only with empty authority\",\n339:         \"guards.denialConstrainsSkillToBeforeAuthority=true and guards.denialRationaleRemainsVisibleForFutureReview=true\"\n340:       ],\n341:       \"tenantEvidenceRequired\": \"Surfacing the policy denial and the constrained Skill record on the live Council Queue is a receipt-backed mutation gated to Epic 2; no tenant Skill row was modified for this slice.\"\n342:     }\n343:   ]\n344: }\n\n(End of file - total 344 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"{\n  \"artifactVersion\": \"2026-07-14\",\n  \"storyKey\": \"5-2-approve-skill-authority-expansion\",\n  \"status\": \"local-contract-not-tenant-verified\",\n  \"purpose\": \"Prove Skill authority expansion approval and denial locally: one new skill install (CSK-LOCAL-MEETING-DIGEST-001) proposes a before authority set (manual_only, no data/tool/external access) and an after authority set adding data access (outlook.calendar.read, dataverse.com_councilworkitem.read) and tool use (email.send) plus an external action, which FR25/FR13 require to be approval-gated; a human (Doug) approval receipt CR-LOCAL-SKILL-APPROVE-001 carries authority basis, rationale, before/after authority sets, and evidence refs, and activation is gated to that receipt (temporal + receipt-chain, not a flag) with the live skill row mutation deferred to Epic 2. A second new skill install (CSK-LOCAL-FABRIC-PUBLISHER-001) proposes a broader expansion (Dataverse write, two Fabric external actions, approved_automatic authority) and is denied by receipt CR-LOCAL-SKILL-DENY-001 (verb policy_denied, result rejected); the skill stays inactive (candidate) constrained to its before authority set with the denial rationale visible for future review. Before/after authority sets differ exactly by the declared delta; receipts here are local contract evidence only and every live mutation stays receipt-gated to Epic 2.\",\n  \"guards\": {\n    \"noTenantWrites\": true,\n    \"noOutboundAction\": true,\n    \"noApprovalExecution\": true,\n    \"requiresExplicitHumanApprovalForExecution\": true,\n    \"sourceRecordsRemainSeparate\": true,\n    \"meaningGraphDoesNotOwnWorkflowState\": true,\n    \"dataverseRowsNotUsedAsCouncilIdentity\": true,\n    \"receiptsAreLocalContractEvidenceOnly\": true,\n    \"receiptsAreAppendOnlyCorrectionsAreNewReceipts\": true,\n    \"authorityExpansionRequiresExplicitApprovalReceipt\": true,\n    \"activationStrictlyFollowsApprovalReceipt\": true,\n    \"denialConstrainsSkillToBeforeAuthority\": true,\n    \"denialRationaleRemainsVisibleForFutureReview\": true,\n    \"noWorkItemStateChangeInThisSlice\": true","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/home/doug/.ringer/work/bmad-hybrid/5-2-approve-skill-authority-expansion/_bmad-output/implementation-artifacts/skill-authority-expansion-slice.json","text":"{\n  \"artifactVersion\": \"2026-07-14\",\n  \"storyKey\": \"5-2-approve-skill-authority-expansion\",\n  \"status\": \"local-contract-not-tenant-verified\",\n  \"purpose\": \"Prove Skill authority expansion approval and denial locally: one new skill install (CSK-LOCAL-MEETING-DIGEST-001) proposes a before authority set (manual_only, no data/tool/external access) and an after authority set adding data access (outlook.calendar.read, dataverse.com_councilworkitem.read) and tool use (email.send) plus an external action, which FR25/FR13 require to be approval-gated; a human (Doug) approval receipt CR-LOCAL-SKILL-APPROVE-001 carries authority basis, rationale, before/after authority sets, and evidence refs, and activation is gated to that receipt (temporal + receipt-chain, not a flag) with the live skill row mutation deferred to Epic 2. A second new skill install (CSK-LOCAL-FABRIC-PUBLISHER-001) proposes a broader expansion (Dataverse write, two Fabric external actions, approved_automatic authority) and is denied by receipt CR-LOCAL-SKILL-DENY-001 (verb policy_denied, result rejected); the skill stays inactive (candidate) constrained to its before authority set with the denial rationale visible for future review. Before/after authority sets differ exactly by the declared delta; receipts here are local contract evidence only and every live mutation stays receipt-gated to Epic 2.\",\n  \"guards\": {\n    \"noTenantWrites\": true,\n    \"noOutboundAction\": true,\n    \"noApprovalExecution\": true,\n    \"requiresExplicitHumanApprovalForExecution\": true,\n    \"sourceRecordsRemainSeparate\": true,\n    \"meaningGraphDoesNotOwnWorkflowState\": true,\n    \"dataverseRowsNotUsedAsCouncilIdentity\": true,\n    \"receiptsAreLocalContractEvidenceOnly\": true,\n    \"receiptsAreAppendOnlyCorrectionsAreNewReceipts\": true,\n    \"authorityExpansionRequiresExplicitApprovalReceipt\": true,\n    \"activationStrictlyFollowsApprovalReceipt\": true,\n    \"denialConstrainsSkillToBeforeAuthority\": true,\n    \"denialRationaleRemainsVisibleForFutureReview\": true,\n    \"noWorkItemStateChangeInThisSlice\": true\n  },\n  \"authoritySetVocabulary\": {\n    \"basis\": \"Manifest com_councilskill has no explicit authority-set column: com_authority_class is a single choice (manual_only/ask_before_use/approved_automatic) and com_allowed_context/com_required_inputs are free multiline text. This slice models an authority set as a Story 5.2 local extension comprising authorityClass, dataScopes, tools, and externalActions, projecting onto com_authority_class plus com_allowed_context. Authority-set members are reproducible local-contract identifiers (for example dataverse.com_councilworkitem.read, email.send), not tenant enum values; adopting them as tenant-wide choice values is a deferred, receipt-gated decision for Epic 2. This is a documented local extension, NOT a claim that the meaning graph owns skill workflow state; guards.meaningGraphDoesNotOwnWorkflowState and guards.noWorkItemStateChangeInThisSlice remain true.\",\n    \"expansionTriggersApproval\": [\n      \"add_data_scope\",\n      \"add_tool_use\",\n      \"add_external_action\",\n      \"broaden_authority_class\"\n    ],\n    \"nonExpandingChanges\": [\n      \"clarify_trigger\",\n      \"fix_proof_owed_text\",\n      \"narrow_authority_class\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"failureCodeVocabulary\": {\n    \"basis\": \"Manifest com_councilreceipt.com_failure_code is a free-text column with no enumerated choice set, so this slice declares a Story 5.2 local extension naming the denial code used here together with its kind, retry allowance, and human-review semantics. Codes are reproducible local-contract identifiers, not tenant enums; adopting them as tenant-wide choice values is a deferred, receipt-gated decision for Epic 2.\",\n    \"codes\": [\n      {\n        \"code\": \"skill_authority_expansion_denied\",\n        \"kind\": \"policy_denial\",\n        \"retryAllowed\": false,\n        \"humanReviewRequired\": true,\n        \"definition\": \"A proposed Skill authority expansion that adds data access, tool use, external action, or a broader authority class was denied because it failed the human-approval or scope-breadth gate (FR25/FR13). The skill remains inactive or constrained to its before authority set; the denial is non-retryable without a policy change or a re-scoped proposal, and the rationale stays visible for future review.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"expansionRun\": {\n    \"runId\": \"SKILL-LOCAL-2026-07-14-001\",\n    \"actorType\": \"human\",\n    \"actorId\": \"Doug\",\n    \"authorityBasis\": \"local non-tenant Story 5.2 contract validation; skill authority expansion is receipt-gated and any live write stays deferred to Epic 2\",\n    \"semanticContractVersion\": \"2026-07-07\",\n    \"inputSlicesFrom\": [\n      \"manual-source-record-slice.json\",\n      \"outlook-source-reference-slice.json\"\n    ],\n    \"decisionPolicy\": {\n      \"authorityExpansionRequiresExplicitHumanApprovalReceipt\": true,\n      \"activationStrictlyFollowsAnApprovalReceiptNotAFlag\": true,\n      \"denialConstrainsTheSkillToItsBeforeAuthoritySet\": true,\n      \"denialRationaleRemainsVisibleForFutureReview\": true,\n      \"beforeAndAfterAuthoritySetsDifferExactlyByTheDeclaredDelta\": true,\n      \"liveSkillMutationReceiptGatedToEpic2\": true,\n      \"receiptsAreAppendOnlyCorrectionsAreNewReceipts\": true\n    },\n    \"skills\": [\n      {\n        \"evidenceStatus\": \"mock_manual_not_tenant_verified\",\n        \"skillRecord\": {\n          \"com_name\": \"Daily meeting digest skill (proposed, candidate)\",\n          \"com_council_skill_id\": \"CSK-LOCAL-MEETING-DIGEST-001\",\n          \"com_trigger\": \"Each weekday morning, summarize the prior day's Council meeting-action notes into a digest for the weekly brief.\",\n          \"com_allowed_context\": \"Project: Council of Minions MVP; scope: meeting-action Work Items captured from the prior day.\",\n          \"com_required_inputs\": \"Prior-day meeting-action Work Items and their linked Source Records.\",\n          \"com_authority_class\": \"manual_only\",\n          \"com_approval_requirements\": \"Requires human (Doug) approval before activation because the install adds Dataverse read access and the email.send tool plus an external action (FR25/FR13).\",\n          \"com_proof_owed\": \"Each digest cites the Work Items and Source Records it summarized; no external send occurs without a prior approval receipt.\",\n          \"com_update_policy\": \"Any authority expansion (added data scope, tool, external action, or broadened authority class) requires a NEW approval receipt; corrections are new receipts, never edits.\",\n          \"com_status\": \"candidate\"\n        },\n        \"expansionKind\": \"installation\",\n        \"sourceRecord\": \"CSR-MANUAL-MEETING-001\",\n        \"proposedExpansion\": {\n          \"beforeAuthoritySet\": {\n            \"authorityClass\": \"manual_only\",\n            \"dataScopes\": [],\n            \"tools\": [],\n            \"externalActions\": []\n          },\n          \"proposedAfterAuthoritySet\": {\n            \"authorityClass\": \"ask_before_use\",\n            \"dataScopes\": [\n              \"outlook.calendar.read\",\n              \"dataverse.com_councilworkitem.read\"\n            ],\n            \"tools\": [\n              \"email.send\"\n            ],\n            \"externalActions\": [\n              \"send_email_on_behalf\"\n            ]\n          },\n          \"declaredDelta\": {\n            \"authorityClassChangedFrom\": \"manual_only\",\n            \"authorityClassChangedTo\": \"ask_before_us